8. Expected Outcome

The expected outcome is a verified, documented and appropriately prepared network traffic dataset suitable for controlled simulation experiments comparing FIFO, PQ and WFQ scheduling algorithms.

The prepared data will support the group's evaluation of throughput, packet delay, packet loss and flow fairness under constrained bandwidth conditions.
